        "event": "room_entered",
        "actions": [
          {
            "type": "showMessage",
            "lines": [
              "Below the Nexus, the Array's infrastructure peels away like dead skin. The ancient architecture of the Spire reasserts itself \u2014 massive vertical conduits that channel raw solar energy from the surface to the core below.",
              "The conduits pulse with blinding light. Energy flows downward in visible streams, following channels carved into crystal walls that glow with their own inner fire. The heat is beyond anything the Array's cooling systems can manage.",
              "This is not a passage designed for machines or humans. This is a focusing instrument \u2014 built to concentrate the power of a star into a single point deep below."
            ]
          }
        ],
